{"about_the_game":"\u300eHauntedManager\u300f is a story about opening a haunted house with ghost staff, where the goal is to ensure no one ever reaches the end.<br>Enjoy a primitive top-down tower defense experience while managing admission restrictions and budget.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171480/extras/c7bf2c0c16640b0bfd2ceaea16315fc2.avif?t=1754467212\" width=640 height=200 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Description</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>You are the manager of a haunted house.<br></li><li>Frighten your guests into leaving before they reach the goal.<br></li><li>Command the playful ghost staff.<br></li><li>Guide guests who start crying to the exit, so they don't ruin the experience for others.<br></li><li>Occasionally, elite ghosts from the main mansion will come to harass you. You can either fend them off or recruit them.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171480/extras/8be43802405d8ac30bfc6f119a644bf2.avif?t=1754467212\" width=640 height=120 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Other Information</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A short game lasting 2-3 hours.<br></li><li>An easy mode is available.<br></li><li>Includes some hand-drawn animations.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Featured Ghost Staff</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Doppelg\u00e4nger: Not even they know whose doppelg\u00e4nger they are. Essentially just a human.<br></li><li>Blakra: The embodiment of the once-famous Blakra. Now too well-known to scare anyone.<br></li><li>Hachishaku: Despite being only seven shaku tall, they make up for it with physical prowess. They're also good at basketball.</li></ul>And many more!","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\u904a\u3093\u3067\u304f\u308c\u3066\u3042\u308a\u304c\u3068\u3046\uff01","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/31